| `FE_BROWSER_FLAGS` | word list | empty | arguments the browser runner's install command accepts | `make fe-browsers` | Passes extra arguments to each app's `test:e2e:browsers` script; CI sets `--with-deps` so the system libraries the browser needs are installed too. | choosing the browser, which each app's `package.json` script and `playwright.config.ts` name together | always |
